DialBench (https://github.com/Event-AHU/DialBench, arXiv 2511.21982)
  What is derived from it, and how:
  - src/dialbench_metrics.py: the metric definitions of benchmark/benchmark.py (extract_last_number and the accumulation of Acc_eps, Acc_theta, Ref and Rel), ported to numpy
    without changing a statement that computes a number. The Wilson interval and the bootstrap in the same file are ours.
  - tests/official_reference.py: a verbatim excerpt of the evaluation logic of benchmark/benchmark.py (the input / output, model, progress-bar and image-saving lines removed). It is
    the oracle that tests/test_dialbench_metrics.py compares the port with.
  - kernels/*/script.py: generated bundles that embed src/dialbench_metrics.py as a string.
